[{:db/id 17592186087775 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-39b56ce3-825a-5cae-ae49-6bfacb30db5c" "question-890e3373-7fb4-50a4-b559-8ada548af125"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186087777 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-79cab45f-9e68-5df9-a9e0-9b0c3611e95a" "question-036dcc56-656f-5be3-b389-bcb0f4704c57"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186087778 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-5ec1eb1a-35a3-5483-b0fc-d5a9a680836b" "question-a7ffe364-7a92-504c-8ec6-763abcbb5581"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186087596 :question/problem "Given that $y = y(t)$ satisfies the equation $y'' - 4y' + 85y = 0,$ which of the following is **not** a solution to this equation?\n\nI. $-2e^{2t}\\cos{9t} + 7e^{2t}\\sin{9t}$\n\nII. $e^{2t}\\cos{9t}+3e^{2t}\\sin{3t}$\n\nIII. $-6e^{2t}\\sin{9t}$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-39b56ce3-825a-5cae-ae49-6bfacb30db5c" :question/id #uuid "39b56ce3-825a-5cae-ae49-6bfacb30db5c" :question/math-academy-id "q-90794" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+2y=0.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let $y={e}^{\\lambda x}.$ Differentiating $y$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x},\\,\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}+2{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}+2) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }^{2}+2=0.\n$$\n\n \n\nThe auxiliary equation has pure imaginary roots:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+2 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2} & =-2 \\\\ \\lambda  & =\\pm \\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-2d07ff77-a6c4-5f49-aa6e-272568f4eaad"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-2d07ff77-a6c4-5f49-aa6e-272568f4eaad" :answer-field/id #uuid "2d07ff77-a6c4-5f49-aa6e-272568f4eaad" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-1b17692c-c9e6-5fb9-b683-710c751d71eb" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0c0d77c8-7efa-509f-bef6-82baddb279d6" "answer-11fa98b4-5ce7-562e-8556-f0c5fde17981" "answer-1b17692c-c9e6-5fb9-b683-710c751d71eb" "answer-7b8c966b-6123-5761-8d43-445de358d1fb" "answer-4dcba3b3-b484-591b-9199-dbe512146957"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0c0d77c8-7efa-509f-bef6-82baddb279d6" :answer/id #uuid "0c0d77c8-7efa-509f-bef6-82baddb279d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\sqrt{2}x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\sqrt{2}x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-11fa98b4-5ce7-562e-8556-f0c5fde17981" :answer/id #uuid "11fa98b4-5ce7-562e-8556-f0c5fde17981" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1b17692c-c9e6-5fb9-b683-710c751d71eb" :answer/id #uuid "1b17692c-c9e6-5fb9-b683-710c751d71eb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7b8c966b-6123-5761-8d43-445de358d1fb" :answer/id #uuid "7b8c966b-6123-5761-8d43-445de358d1fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{x}(P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x))" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4dcba3b3-b484-591b-9199-dbe512146957" :answer/id #uuid "4dcba3b3-b484-591b-9199-dbe512146957" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{x}(P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x))" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-890e3373-7fb4-50a4-b559-8ada548af125" :question/id #uuid "890e3373-7fb4-50a4-b559-8ada548af125" :question/math-academy-id "q-79611" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+81y=0.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let $y={e}^{\\lambda x}.$ Differentiating $y$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x},\\,\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}+81{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}+81) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }^{2}+81=0.\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation has pure imaginary roots:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+81 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2} & =-81 \\\\ \\lambda  & =\\pm 9\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(9x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(9x).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9b5fd536-e6d8-5681-9668-0ebbff4ffc2f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9b5fd536-e6d8-5681-9668-0ebbff4ffc2f" :answer-field/id #uuid "9b5fd536-e6d8-5681-9668-0ebbff4ffc2f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-07b4249e-69dd-59cf-b52b-1c6c4a33e356" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6ccdaae6-8946-5a17-88e5-edb6ce7cbfa8" "answer-17a24000-d1ae-5136-a384-a4ac9e0ce633" "answer-07b4249e-69dd-59cf-b52b-1c6c4a33e356" "answer-448487a5-9552-5c98-a142-dc48b8aa610f" "answer-4a87e083-8bfc-5269-80d1-c0f3cccf05ad"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6ccdaae6-8946-5a17-88e5-edb6ce7cbfa8" :answer/id #uuid "6ccdaae6-8946-5a17-88e5-edb